{"availability":"available","full":"aloth/RogueGPT","name":"RogueGPT","description":"Modular multi-model generator of controllable AI news stimuli for misinformation research - agent-based simulation seeding, red-teaming & human-perception studies. GPT-4/LLaMA/Mistral/DeepSeek, multilingual, full provenance. Stimuli are evaluated by human raters in JudgeGPT.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":8,"forks":3,"created":"2024-03-21T21:06:40Z","updated":"2026-09-30T08:02:02Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://aloth.github.io/RogueGPT/","topics":["agent-based-simulation","ai-content-generation","ai-safety","controlled-experiment","ethical-ai","fake-news","fake-news-generator","generative-ai","llm-agents","llms","mcp","mongodb","news-generation","openai","red-teaming","research-methodology","stimulus-generation","streamlit","synthetic-data","synthetic-text"],"demo":"https://aloth.github.io/RogueGPT/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T12:27:27.292Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T12:27:27.292Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T12:27:27.292Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T16:32:53.402Z","stars":8,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-08T21:24:45.710Z","stars":8,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-11T11:02:53.043Z","stars":8,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-17T12:27:27.292Z","stars":8,"forks":3}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["RogueGPT is research instrumentation. It generates controlled, fully parameterised news fragments so that researchers can measure how people and detectors respond to synthetic news under experimental conditions.","It is the upstream stage of a three-part pipeline: CRED-1 identifies unreliable sources, RogueGPT produces the stimuli, and JudgeGPT collects human judgements that link back to the exact generation parameters.","Scope and safeguards. The framework produces short fragments for delivery inside studies. It has no publishing, posting, distribution, scheduling, or audience-targeting capability, and none is planned. Researchers supply their own API credentials, so generation stays attributable and the upstream providers' usage policies continue to apply. Human data collection through JudgeGPT is subject to institutional ethics review, the corpus is archived under restricted academic access, and the software is GPL-3.0 so derivative work stays open to inspection. See Limitations and Disclaimer."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aloth/RogueGPT/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d45cf45c420d0f3d49bec1411c633ac4ccd3fb075b5d3d932f03b138c19b858a","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T16:32:53.889Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T14:34:45.623Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"RogueGPT is research instrumentation. It generates controlled, fully parameterised news fragments so that researchers can measure how people and detectors respond to synthetic news under experimental conditions.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aloth/RogueGPT/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"d45cf45c420d0f3d49bec1411c633ac4ccd3fb075b5d3d932f03b138c19b858a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aloth/RogueGPT/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T14:34:45.624Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-30T08:02:02Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aloth/RogueGPT/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T14:34:45.625Z","hash":"d45cf45c420d0f3d49bec1411c633ac4ccd3fb075b5d3d932f03b138c19b858a","originalBytes":28215,"storedBytes":28215,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T16:32:53.402Z","subjects":["Simulation & physics","MCP servers & agents"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"AI & machine learning","subjects":["Simulation & physics","MCP servers & agents"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Simulation & physics","source":"metadata","match":"simulation"},{"subject":"MCP servers & agents","source":"metadata","ma